olve the bounded DFA ladder problem:"]}, "id": "BB_2", "from_name": "transcription", "to_name": "image", "type": "textarea", "origin": "prediction-changed"}, {"original_width": 640, "original_height": 358, "image_rotation": 0, "value": {"x": 72.00000000000006, "y": 37.982195845697326, "width": 22.12244065281894, "height": 39.91780415430266, "rotation": 0}, "id": "BB_3", "from_name": "bbox", "to_name": "image", "type": "rectangle", "origin": "prediction-changed"}, {"original_width": 640, "original_height": 358, "image_rotation": 0, "value": {"x": 72.00000000000006, "y": 37.982195845697326, "width": 22.12244065281894, "height": 39.91780415430266, "rotation": 0, "labels": ["image"]}, "id": "BB_3", "from_name": "label", "to_name": "image", "type": "labels", "origin": "prediction-changed"}, {"original_width": 640, "original_height": 358, "image_rotation": 0, "value": {"x": 72.00000000000006, "y": 37.982195845697326, "width": 22.12244065281894, "height": 39.91780415430266, "rotation": 0, "text": [""]}, "id": "BB_3", "from_name": "transcription", "to_name": "image", "type": "textarea", "origin": "prediction-changed"}, {"original_width": 640, "original_height": 358, "image_rotation": 0, "value": {"x": 1.327893175074184, "y": 32.047477744807125, "width": 71.04228486646885, "height": 43.026706231454014, "rotation": 0}, "id": "WDBtZ1-uYS", "from_name": "bbox", "to_name": "image", "type": "rectangle", "origin": "manual"}, {"original_width": 640, "original_height": 358, "image_rotation": 0, "value": {"x": 1.327893175074184, "y": 32.047477744807125, "width": 71.04228486646885, "height": 43.026706231454014, "rotation": 0, "labels": ["equation"]}, "id": "WDBtZ1-uYS", "from_name": "label", "to_name": "image", "type": "labels", "origin": "manual"}, {"original_width": 640, "original_height": 358, "image_rotation": 0, "value": {"x": 1.327893175074184, "y": 32.047477744807125, "width": 71.04228486646885, "height": 43.026706231454014, "rotation": 0, "text": ["BOUNDED-LADDER_DFA = {(B, u, v, b) | B a DFA and u \u2192_b v by a ladder in L(B)}\n\nB-L = \"On input (B, u, v, b) Let m = |u| = |v|.\n1. For b = 1, accept if u, v \u2208 L(B) and differ in \u2264 1 place, else reject.\n2. For b > 1, repeat for each w \u2208 L(B) of length |u|\n3. Recursively test u \u2192_b/2 w and w \u2192_b/2 v [division rounds up]\n4. Accept both accept.\n5. Reject [if all fail].\"\n\nTest (B, u, v) \u2208 LADDER_DFA with B-L procedure on input (B, u, v, t) for t = |\u03a3|^m"]}, "id": "WDBtZ1-uYS", "from_name": "transcription", "to_name": "image", "type": "textarea", "origin": "manual"}], "created_username": "12. Doshisha nlp_annot_12@naist.ac.jp, 18", "created_ago": "0\u00a0minutes", "completed_by": {"id": 18, "first_name": "12. Doshisha", "last_name": "", "email": "nlp_annot_12@naist.ac.jp"}, "task": {"id": 139377, "data": {"ocr": "/lectrans/data/local-files/?d=/large/datas/frederikus-h/lectrans-testset/25.10.annot_tools/label-studio/ocr_check_storage_source/lec_slides/theory_of_computation/aVv9WXwW95w/17.aVv9WXwW95w-Scene-0183-01.jpg", "text": "/lectrans/data/local-files/?d=/large/datas/frederikus-h/lectrans-testset/25.10.annot_tools/label-studio/ocr_check_storage_source/gpt_41mini_outs/theory_of_computation/aVv9WXwW95w/17.aVv9WXwW95w-Scene-0183-01.txt"}, "meta": {}, "created_at": "2025-11-01T12:32:51.910771Z", "updated_at": "2025-11-01T12:32:51.920196Z", "is_labeled": true, "overlap": 1, "inner_id": 240, "total_annotations": 1, "cancelled_annotations": 0, "total_predictions": 1, "comment_count": 0, "unresolved_comment_count": 0, "last_comment_updated_at": null, "project": 31, "updated_by": 1, "file_upload": null, "comment_authors": []}, "was_cancelled": false, "ground_truth": false, "created_at": "2025-11-20T02:40:00.754113Z", "updated_at": "2025-11-20T02:40:00.754185Z", "draft_created_at": "2025-11-20T02:39:13.538312Z", "lead_time": 49.531000000000006, "import_id": null, "last_action": null, "bulk_created": false, "project": 31, "updated_by": 18, "parent_prediction"